  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During an iron beak bird chase she lies on the ground looking weak, with torn clothes and messy hair. Ma Hong Yun nearly runs past her until she trips him; she then asks, “Young master, please save me,” and he carries her away.",
      "chapters": [
        577
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ma_hong_yun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chang Li lies on the ground, weak and feeble. Her clothes are torn, revealing her alluring shoulder. Her hair is messy. She looks pitiful, like a fearful rabbit. Ma Hong Yun sees a beautiful lady.",
      "chapters": [
        577
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Banquet guests name Chang Li beautiful and pleasant.",
      "chapters": [
        578
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At a banquet Chang Biao presents the rescue as a hero saving a beauty and says his daughter’s heart has fixed on that young hero. Guests note that Chang Li is not his own daughter by birth, but that he raised her from youth and treats her as a beloved daughter, so marrying her would make Chang Biao Ma Hong Yun’s father-in-law.",
      "chapters": [
        578
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marriage-alliance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chang_biao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chang Biao and Ma Ying Jie later set the engagement, and Ma Ying Jie tells Ma Hong Yun the first day of the next month will be their celebration.",
      "chapters": [
        579
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marriage-alliance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ma_ying_jie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chang Biao adopted several orphans to cover the secret of his biological son Chang Ji You; Chang Li is among those adopted sons and daughters.",
      "chapters": [
        580
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marriage-alliance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chang_ji_you"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ma Hong Yun calls her his wife Xiao Li. Chang Biao had married his adopted daughter to him to coax Ma Ying Jie, and she becomes Ma Hong Yun’s wife. Giant Sun’s will brings her and Zhao Lian Yun into Eighty-Eight True Yang Building when Ma Hong Yun is pressed to become an owner of Imperial Court blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        613
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wife-under-imperial-court-collapse",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhao_lian_yun",
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
        "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Giant Sun’s will later states she never sincerely loved Ma Hong Yun: Chang Biao treated her as a political bargaining chip aimed at Ma Ying Jie, and after Chang Biao’s death she stayed by Ma Hong Yun for lack of backing, while his rise to rank three and elder status still gave her a good life. That will also tells Ma Hong Yun the staged rescue and her approach were deliberate, which leaves her deathly pale and trembling.",
      "chapters": [
        614
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wife-under-imperial-court-collapse",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When treemen attack during the land spirit crisis, she dies under their assaults while Ma Hong Yun and Zhao Lian Yun survive under Frost Jade Peacock’s recognition.",
      "chapters": [
        616
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wife-under-imperial-court-collapse",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_frost_jade_peacock"
      ]
    }
  ],
